{"id":"bezrazlichno","lemma":"безразлично","pos":"adv","rank":4958,"glosses":["indifferently"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e4/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D0%B5%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мне безразлично, что ты делаешь.","en":"I don't care what you do.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]},{"text":"Нам безразлично, что он делает.","en":"We don't care what he does.","words":[{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]},{"text":"Том сказал, что ему безразлично.","en":"Tom said that he doesn't care.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},null]},{"text":"Тому безразлично, что думают другие.","en":"Tom doesn't care about what other people think.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"other","l":"другой"}]},{"text":"Я не знаю, и мне безразлично.","en":"I don't know, nor do I care.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null],"phrases":[[0,3,"I don’t know"]]}]}